sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Player (Browser UI)
    participant HTTP as Chi HTTP Handler + JWT Auth
    participant Svc as Simulation Service
    participant Engine as Simulation Engine<br/>(World→Network→Channels→Energy→Storage→Crafting)
    participant Repo as SQLite Repository (WAL)

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Repo: Phase 1 — Static Network Validation
        User->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/projects/{projectId}/validate
        HTTP->>Svc: ValidateProject(ctx, userID, projectID)
        Svc->>Repo: Load Project, CompatibilityProfile, Blocks, Patterns & Inventory
        Repo-->>Svc: ProjectAggregate
        Svc->>Engine: Validate(snapshot, profile, catalog)
        activate Engine
        Engine->>Engine: 1. World: Assemble 3D voxel grid & Controller/CPU multiblocks
        Engine->>Engine: 2. Network: Partition connected components (colors, anchors, directional push faces)
        Engine->>Engine: 3. Channels: Run 3-stage solver (local 8ch → dense 32ch → controller face 32ch)
        Engine->>Engine: 4. Energy: Compute FE→AE generation, buffers & passive drain
        Engine->>Engine: 5. Storage: Index online ME Drives by priority, partition & byte/type capacity
        Engine->>Engine: 6. Diagnostics: Emit structural, channel, energy & unsupported-block diagnostics
        Engine-->>Svc: ValidationResult (valid, summary, diagnostics, overlay)
        deactivate Engine
        Svc-->>HTTP: ValidationResult
        HTTP-->>User: 200 OK (Channel/Network Overlay + Diagnostics)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User,Repo: Phase 2 — Stateful Crafting Simulation & Deterministic Tick Stepping
        User->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/projects/{projectId}/simulations (seed, crafting_request)
        HTTP->>Svc: StartSimulation(ctx, userID, projectID, req)
        Svc->>Repo: Load ProjectAggregate
        Repo-->>Svc: ProjectAggregate
        Svc->>Engine: NewSimulation(snapshot, seed, craftingRequest)
        Engine->>Engine: Plan recursive crafting tree, allocate Crafting CPU bytes & reserve Storage inputs
        Engine-->>Svc: Initial SimulationState (tick=0) + Diagnostics + Events
        Svc->>Repo: Insert simulation_runs, simulation_events & simulation_diagnostics (TX)
        Repo-->>Svc: Persisted SimulationRun
        Svc-->>HTTP: SimulationRun (status=running, current_tick=0)
        HTTP-->>User: 201 Created

        loop Step N Ticks Until Completed or Paused
            User->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/simulations/{simulationId}/step (ticks=N)
            HTTP->>Svc: StepSimulation(ctx, userID, simulationID, ticks)
            Svc->>Repo: GetSimulationRun(simulationID)
            Repo-->>Svc: Snapshot + Current State
            Svc->>Engine: Step(state, ticks)
            activate Engine
            Engine->>Engine: Energy Tick: Convert FE→AE, charge Energy Cells, deduct drain (check brownout)
            Engine->>Engine: Crafting Tick: Dispatch up to (1 + co_processors) batches via Pattern Providers
            Engine->>Engine: Machine Tick: Advance Molecular Assemblers & External Machines; return outputs
            Engine->>Engine: Storage Tick: Insert crafted items into highest-priority matching ME Drive cells
            Engine->>Engine: Overlay & Diagnostics: Refresh live CPU jobs, cell occupancy & sequence events
            Engine-->>Svc: Updated State, Tick Events[], Diagnostics[]
            deactivate Engine
            Svc->>Repo: Update simulation_runs + Append simulation_events & diagnostics (TX)
            Repo-->>Svc: Committed Step
            Svc-->>HTTP: SimulationStepResult (tick, events, diagnostics, state)
            HTTP-->>User: 200 OK (Updated 3D Overlay, CPU Job Progress & Event Log)
        end
    end
